<v Ira Glass>[鸣谢]

00:57:32.320 --> 00:57:58.630
<v Ira Glass>Musical advice from R.J. Smith. To buy a cassette of this or any of our programs, call us here at WBEZ in Chicago, 312- 832-3380. Or visit our website where you can buy tapes, or you could also listen to our programs for free online, www.thisamericanlife.org. Special bonus tracks on the website this week. This American Life is distributed by Public Radio International.
<v Ira Glass>音乐顾问：R.J.史密斯。如需购买本节目或我们任何节目的录音带，请拨打我们芝加哥WBEZ的电话：312-832-3380。或者访问我们的网站购买磁带，您也可以在网上免费收听我们的节目：www.thisamericanlife.org。本周网站上有特别奖励曲目。《美国生活》由公共广播国际分发。

00:57:58.630 --> 00:58:12.660
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]
<v Ira Glass>[资金鸣谢]

00:58:12.660 --> 00:58:22.350
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who knew that I would be a perfect public radio employee when he sidled up to me in a bar one night, years ago, and demanded--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督：托里·马拉蒂亚。他很早就知道我会成为一名完美的公共电台员工，因为多年前的一个晚上，他在一家酒吧侧身靠近我，要求——

00:58:22.350 --> 00:58:23.720
<v Kevin>Buy me a drink.
<v Kevin>给我买杯酒。

00:58:23.720 --> 00:58:56.150
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

